    "content": "Particle Network, the modular Layer 1 blockchain pioneering chain abstraction, has achieved a landmark milestone with over 50 million transactions processed on its incentivized testnet. By abstracting away the friction of fragmented blockchains, gas tokens, and manual bridges, Particle Network allows users to operate a single balance across every Web3 ecosystem.\n\n## How Universal Accounts and Universal Liquidity Work\n\nIn the current multi-chain paradigm, users must maintain separate wallets, bridge assets across networks, and acquire distinct gas tokens (ETH, SOL, AVAX, BNB) for each transaction. Particle Network eliminates this fragmentation through three foundational components:\n\n- **Universal Accounts**: An ERC-4337 smart account infrastructure anchored to the Particle L1 that unifies a user's identity and addresses across EVM, Solana, Bitcoin, and Cosmos.\n- **Universal Liquidity**: Liquidity routing contracts that automatically pull funds from whichever chain holds available balances to execute transactions seamlessly on any target network.\n- **Universal Gas**: Users can pay network fees on any supported blockchain using any token of their choice, including USDC, USDT, or native $PARTI.\n\n> \"Chain abstraction is the necessary catalyst for onboarded billions to Web3,\" explained the Particle development foundation. \"Users should not need to understand RPC endpoints, bridges, or gas currencies. They simply interact with applications.\"\n\n## Developer Adoption and Ecosystem Partnerships\n\nOver 900 decentralized applications (dApps) across gaming, DeFi, and SocialFi have integrated Particle's SDKs to offer one-click onboarding via social logins (Google, Apple, Twitter). \n\nMajor Layer 2 networks—including Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, and Linea—have aligned with Particle Network to standardize cross-chain account recovery and automated state settlement.\n\n## Checklist for Testnet Hunters and $PARTI Eligibility\n\n- **Minting Universal Account**: Connect your Web3 wallet to the Particle Pioneer portal to generate your official Universal Account.\n- **Cross-Chain Gasless Swaps**: Execute multi-chain transfers and collect Particle Points (PARTI Points) daily.\n- **Node Validation**: Run lightweight booster nodes on testnet to confirm transaction finality and earn priority genesis quotas."
